"CODEOWNERS，不声明独立人工评审； GitHub branch rules 与 required checks 的实际配置状态仍须远程核实。 "
"具体命令见[维护工具](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/tools/maintenance/README.md)。"
msgstr ""
